{
  "$comment": "Display contract (architecture 4, ADR-056): how probabilities are drawn and labelled in Telegram. Read by the Worker (apps/bot/src/format/display.ts) and by the Python job (apps/fit/src/footy/report/display.py); a Vitest, a pytest and scripts/cross-language.test.mjs pin it. Display only: nothing here changes a stored number.",
